DASH.glossary.hl={m:"Breadth",d:"New highs = NYSE stocks at a 52-week high; new lows = at a 52-week low. Index up while lows still dominate = a narrow bounce. Latest session (Wed 25 Nov): 33 highs vs 259 lows (WSJ): the most highs since 12 Nov but also the most lows since Friday 20 Nov's 565, the most in our chart (which starts 6 Oct). Tuesday was 31 vs 144. Lows have beaten highs on every session this month except 4 Nov; more highs than lows would be the first real sign of healing."};

